# Copy to .env and adjust. The Makefile exports these automatically;
# for direct `ofi` calls, run `set -a; . ./.env; set +a` first.
# No credentials are needed: the Tardis.dev first-of-month files are free.

# Where raw downloads and intermediate parquet files go (~17 GB for the full study).
# Default: ./data inside the repository.
# OFI_DATA_DIR=/mnt/big-disk/ofi-data

# Repository root used for reports/ and research/ outputs.
# Default: the checkout the package was installed from.
# OFI_PROJECT_DIR=/path/to/ofi-crypto-perps
